  "content": "\n\n<h1><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/jmJ87gsb/images/527602ce254ed3b68f42d40960928767639d7760.png\" width=\"808\" height=\"444\"></h1>\n<h3>&nbsp;</h3>\n<h3><strong>關於：</strong></h3>\n<p><strong>Delightful Creators</strong> 是一款針對 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/farmers-delight\" rel=\"nofollow\">Farmer's Delight</a> 與 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create</a> 的擴充模組，利用 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create</a> 添加全新配方。目前新增了多種液體與配方，對整合包相當實用。</p>\n<p>也提供 Fabric 版本，點擊 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/delightful-creators-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">此處</a> 即可下載！</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3><strong>目前內容：</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>為「序列組裝」（Sequenced Assembly）新增未完成的食材。</li>\n<li>為湯品、燉菜、醬汁等新增對應液體。</li>\n<li>可在攪拌機中混合材料來製作液體。</li>\n<li>可使用燉菜或湯品填滿碗皿。</li>\n<li>可將南瓜派進行切割。</li>\n<li>新增蜂蜜餅乾與甜莓餅乾的配方。</li>\n<li>新增巧克力派的配方。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3><strong>多語言支援：</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>英文 (en_us) - <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/Flomik\" rel=\"nofollow\">Flomik</a></li>\n<li>俄文 (ru_ru) - <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/Flomik\" rel=\"nofollow\">Flomik</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fclients%252faff.php%253faff%253d6136\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/4JkTnRF/banner.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"180\" height=\"180\"></a></p>",
